[[Refined Homestead Metal]] is a [[crafting material]] used for [[Homestead]] [[Decoration|decorations]]. It is obtained by refining common [[metal]] types at the [[Homestead Refinement—Metal Forge]]. Up to 200 refined Homestead metal can be initially obtained by refining metal every week. This limit can be permanently increased by purchasing metal trade capacity upgrades at the Homestead Refinement-Metal Forge.

Refined Homestead metal can also be bought with [[coin]]s on the Black Market tab. The black market prices increase after each purchase but reset back to the original price after every [[weekly reset]]. Refined Homestead Metal bought this way doesn't count towards the weekly cap.

